months after the date of this prospectus) as our general partner and TC
Services, in their sole discretion, may agree, the escrow agent will promptly
notify us, this offering will be terminated and the escrow agent, at its
option, will either return your subscription agreement or send you notice of
its destruction.</FONT></P>

