expect that the term of the credit facility will initially be for one year,
unless terminated upon 90 days&#146; advance notice by either the Fund or TIAA in
its sole discretion, and that such one-year term will automatically renew every
year unless terminated upon prior written notice by either the Fund or TIAA as
lender. Interest accruing under the line of credit will be payable to TIAA.</FONT></P>

