Fund and its subsidiaries?</B></FONT></P>

<P> <BR><FONT SIZE=2>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A: The Fund intends
to make its investments primarily through a subsidiary, which will elect to be
taxed as a REIT, or through one or more other subsidiaries of the Fund, which
may or may not elect to be taxed as a REIT. The Fund may also own real estate
related assets directly. Currently, the Fund is the managing member of
TIAA-CREF USREF I REIT, LLC, which will elect to be taxed as a REIT, and has
