<P STYLE='MARGIN-RIGHT:0IN; MARGIN-LEFT:0IN'><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Under
Statement of Financial Accounting Standard No. 13, Accounting for Leases, if
