<div><FONT SIZE=3> </FONT></div>

<P><FONT SIZE=2><B><I>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Independent
Valuations</I></B>. At the beginning of each calendar
year, the Appraisal Unit will develop a staggered valuation plan with the
objective of having approximately one-fourth of all of our wholly owned
