<P> <FONT SIZE=2 FACE=ARIAL><BR>
<B>Considerations for U.S. Governmental Pension
Plans<BR>
</B></FONT> </P>

<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The
income derived by a U.S. State or any political subdivision thereof from the
exercise of an essential governmental function is not subject to U.S. federal
