tax-exempt entity, by reason of a determination that it meets the requirements
of Code Section 401(a), may be subject to the unrelated business income tax by
reason of its status as a tax-exempt entity. Accordingly, governmental plans
should consult with their tax advisors prior to an investment in the Fund.</FONT></P>

