<P><FONT SIZE=2 FACE=ARIAL><B><I>Annual Distribution Requirements</I></B></FONT></P>
<P><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;In
    order to qualify as a REIT, a REIT is required to make distributions, other
